  "2026-09-07T22:36:19.239Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: a strict full read of all 2656 items across every status had zero omissions, and complete-metadata searches found no claim-specific compact receipt item. Full live pm-nilh metadata and all 19 historical events identify the shipped create/update baseline. The duplicate guard matched that broad feature through shared GitHub #437; this is a distinct claim conformance defect, following the existing separate parity-defect precedent. Reopening the historical feature was tested and would remove its shipped July changelog entry, so retain its historical closure and record the claim-specific scope here. Explicit duplicate acknowledgement applies only to this false-positive broad-feature match. Current isolated no-extension reproduction at 94532b596: create returns 71 bytes with id/status/changed_field_count; claim returns 517 bytes with full item/claimed_by/previous_assignee/forced. Intake only, open and unclaimed."
  "2026-09-08T07:52:17.597Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: claim change-field assertions and ownership projection failed against baseline. SDK now returns claim delta fields and idempotent repeat claims return zero delta; shared projection retains ownership and selection outcomes. Focused 46 tests passed. MCP dispatch and installed-consumer acceptance remain to be completed."
  "2026-09-08T08:33:18.643Z","harness:codex","Full canonical suite passed all 8579 tests across 643 files. Exact coverage is 100 percent statements/functions/lines with two new CLI multi-target dry-run branches uncovered; claim has complete coverage. Static quality found runClaim complexity 17 against maximum16, so ownership changes are now compared through a two-field typed filter; the gate remains unchanged. Focused validation is running."
  "2026-09-08T08:39:18.598Z","harness:codex","Installed npm and Bun consumers each returned a 140-byte serialized compact claim receipt for an item with an 18000-byte description; repeated claim returned changed_field_count=0. Explicit full CLI and typed SDK claim retained the description. Both consumers completed close, release and resolution/history-drift validation in isolated workspaces."
  "2026-09-08T08:53:54.467Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: All 8579 tests passed at exact 100/100/100/100, including real CLI/MCP ownership and ranked-claim cases. Both linked claim suites passed. Installed npm and Bun consumers returned 140-byte serialized compact receipts for 18000-byte descriptions, zero-change repeat receipts, and full CLI/SDK readback. Structural quality and idle transport gates passed. Hosted review and merge verification follow this reviewed closure."
